## 7. Warehouse Optimization Service Boundary (`WarehouseOptimizationService`)

The `WarehouseOptimizationService` encapsulates all business logic, data validation, and algorithm execution.

### Service Workflow & Data Pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Router as API Router
    participant Service as WarehouseOptimizationService
    participant Repo as DB Repository
