## 8. AI Agent Layer & Tool Interface

### 8.1 Warehouse Agent Responsibilities & Rules
The `WarehouseAgent` provides intelligent orchestration and natural-language diagnostic reasoning for warehouse managers.

#### Allowed Responsibilities:
- Inspect current pending orders and warehouse congestion.
- Trigger optimization pipeline via domain tools.
- Explain trade-offs in generated batches (e.g., why an urgent order was placed in a separate batch).
- Recommend inventory re-positioning when high-demand items are stored in distant zones.

#### Prohibited Actions:
- ❌ Direct SQL execution or database schema mutation.
- ❌ Overriding inventory balance records.
- ❌ Fabricating non-existent graph nodes or locations.
- ❌ Bypassing domain service validation checks.

### 8.2 Agent Tool Contracts (9 Tools)

