### 11.2 Failure & Fallback Matrix

| Failure Mode | Detection Mechanism | Immediate Fallback Action | Operational Impact |
|---|---|---|---|
| **PostgreSQL Unreachable** | SQLAlchemy `OperationalError` | Return 503 DB Unavailable error envelope | System halts safely; no corrupt writes |
| **Unreachable Graph Node** | Dijkstra open-set empty | Mark step as `UNREACHABLE`; route around node | Picker notified to bypass location |
| **Insufficient Inventory** | `inventory.quantity < required` | Exclude order from batching; create low-stock alert | Order delayed until replenishment |
| **Optimization Timeout** | Thread timeout (>2.0 sec) | Abort 2-Opt solver; return Greedy Nearest-Neighbor route | Sub-optimal route returned within SLA |
| **LLM Provider Offline** | Connection refusal / HTTP 5xx | Switch `WarehouseAgent` to deterministic template response | Explanations simplified; optimization unaffected |

